# NEVER commit the plaintext key or the Fernet secret.
# NOTE: .gitignore has no trailing-comment syntax — a line like
#   answer_key.json      # NEVER commit plaintext key
# is read as a pattern containing the spaces and the '#', so it matches nothing
# and the file stays committable. Comments must be on their own line.
# (The build spec's .gitignore snippet has exactly that bug; `git check-ignore -v`
# confirmed both files were unignored before this fix.)
answer_key.json
.answer_key_secret
*.faiss
index/
